# The web app lives in /app of this repo, but it is SERVED by a second Pages
# project (iqraflow-webapp) whose root directory is /app - so it sits at the
# root of app.iqraflow.app and its absolute asset paths resolve.
#
# This project also has the folder in its output, so anyone landing on
# iqraflow.app/app is sent to the domain that actually serves it correctly.
/app/*  https://app.iqraflow.app/:splat  301
/app    https://app.iqraflow.app/        301
